  "sourceFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Plevel</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> May 2008 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <p>Práce z mateřské školky.</p>\n<p>Zadání bylo vystřihovat z barevného papíru kvetoucí květiny a složit z nich obrázek.</p>\n<p>Místo květin jsem vytvořil plevel.</p>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/plevel-obr-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/plevel-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"plevel\"> </a>  </figure> </div> ",
  "translatedFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Weeds</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> May 2008 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <p>A project from preschool.</p>\n<p>The assignment was to cut out blooming flowers from colored paper and assemble them into a picture.</p>\n<p>Instead of flowers, I created weeds.</p>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/plevel-obr-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/plevel-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"plevel\"> </a>  </figure> </div> ",
